    "category": "Water meter",
    "type_designations": ["MA408K"],
    "module_designation": "Ultrasonic water meters with electronic indication device",
    "description": "Residential compact ultrasonic water meter MA408K with electronic indication device, with internal valve for local control and remote control. Measurement is based on the ultrasonic bidirectional transit-time principle (difference in time-of-flight of ultrasonic pulses downstream and upstream). Measures, memorizes and displays the volume of clean water passing through the measurement transducers at metering conditions. Can be installed in horizontal and vertical positions; reverse flow measurement is not relevant."
